  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This comfortable, family friendly home is located in a quiet, residential community. This rustic beach house features a downstairs apartment with fully-equipped kitchen, living/dining area and washing machine and dryer plus two bedrooms and one bath. The upper two floors makeup another complete unit with four bedrooms, two baths and living, dining, and kitchen areas and washing machine and dryer - great for two families sharing a vacation. <br><br>Large porches, a private fenced-in pool, easy beach access and wonderful gulf views make this house a perfect family vacation spot.<br><br>In order to avoid the crowds, we offer a convenient and quieter, Sunday to Sunday check in/check out. This allows you to avoid the traffic on Saturday when other vacationers are traveling. <br><br><br>The house is also located 2 miles from Grayton Beach and 4 miles from Seaside and Water Color. There are sidewalks the entire distance to these locations, so a family bike ride is a perfect get away from the beach. <br><br>**Please note: During the off season months the house may be rented as either a 2 bedroom one bath, 4 bedroom 2 bath or full house of 6 bedroom 3 baths. The rate will be adjusted accordingly to reflect the reduced house size during these three months. <br><br>Keywords: House",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Emerald Coast Get Away"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
    "notes": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Extra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy",
            "Government-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges",
            "Special requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed",
            "Onsite parties or group events are strictly prohibited",
            "Host has not indicated whether there is a carbon monoxide detector on the property; consider bringing a portable detector with you on the trip",
            "Host has indicated there is a smoke detector on the property",
            "Safety features at this property include a fire extinguisher and a deadbolt lock",
            "This property has outdoor spaces, such as balconies, patios, terraces which may not be suitable for children; if you have concerns, we recommend contacting the property prior to your arrival to confirm they can accommodate you in a suitable room"
          ],
          "title": "You need to know"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Important information"
    }
  },
